        "theme":  "Strategy",
        "summary":  "CIO.com identifies six high-stakes strategic tensions technology leaders must navigate simultaneously: foundational vs. growth investment, innovation vs. operational resilience, innovation vs. risk management, speed vs. organizational readiness, data accessibility vs. data protection, and AI usage vs. cost. A December 2025 IDC survey found 96% of organizations reported AI costs exceeding expectations, underscoring the urgency of the cost-versus-value tension. The piece draws on interviews with multiple CIOs to ground each trade-off in current enterprise realities.",
