        "summary":  "CIO.com profiles how enterprise AI leaders are restructuring governance and organizational design to manage AI\u0027s unique risk profileΓÇöincluding AI\u0027s indeterminate behavior and the shadow-use risk that emerges when employees route around slow AI approvals. Zuora\u0027s three-year AI journey illustrates a maturity model progressing through four levels, from basic platform access through zero-touch application creation, achieving 10x-25x throughput improvements in early deployments. The article features voices on building \u0027conflict by design\u0027 governance structures.",
